meta {
  name: List credentials
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{identityMgmtUrl}}/v1/credentials
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  The credentials this identity holds (id, types, issuer, profile, expiry), such as the
  MembershipCredential that scripts/dev-identities.sh asked for. Since 1.4 each also has
  status (VALID, REVOKED, SUSPENDED or UNCHECKABLE; null until checked) and
  statusCheckedAt, from the status check every PORTITOR_CREDENTIAL_STATUS_CHECK_SECONDS
  (default 60). Only a VALID or never checked credential is presented to verifiers.
}
